; Tauri CLI 2.10.1 custom-message keys, plus FlashRun's MUI page copy.
LangString addOrReinstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Repair or reinstall"
LangString alreadyInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "FlashRun is already installed"
LangString alreadyInstalledLong ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${PRODUCTNAME} ${VERSION} is already installed. Choose an action, then click Next."
LangString appRunning ${LANG_ENGLISH} "FlashRun is running. Save your work and close it before continuing."
LangString appRunningOkKill ${LANG_ENGLISH} "FlashRun is running.$\r$\nSave your work before continuing. Click OK to stop FlashRun, or Cancel to go back."
LangString chooseMaintenanceOption ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose how to update this installation."
LangString choowHowToInstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose who can use ${PRODUCTNAME}."
LangString createDesktop ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Create a FlashRun desktop shortcut"
LangString dontUninstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Keep the existing installation"
LangString dontUninstallDowngrade ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Keep the existing installation (uninstalling first is required to downgrade)"
LangString failedToKillApp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "FlashRun could not be stopped. Close it manually, then try again."
LangString installingWebview2 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime..."
LangString newerVersionInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "A newer version of ${PRODUCTNAME} is installed. Installing an older version is not recommended. If you continue, consider uninstalling the current version first."
LangString older ${LANG_ENGLISH} "older"
LangString olderOrUnknownVersionInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "An $R4 version of ${PRODUCTNAME} is installed. Choose whether to uninstall it before installing this version, then click Next."
LangString silentDowngrades ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This installer does not allow silent downgrades. Run the installer interactively to review the available options.$\r$\n"
LangString unableToUninstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The existing installation could not be removed."
LangString uninstallApp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Uninstall ${PRODUCTNAME}"
LangString uninstallBeforeInstalling ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Uninstall the existing version first"
LangString unknown ${LANG_ENGLISH} "unknown"
LangString webview2AbortError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime could not be installed. FlashRun needs this runtime to display its interface. Check your connection and try again."
LangString webview2DownloadError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 download failed. Details: $0"
LangString webview2DownloadSuccess ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 installer downloaded."
LangString webview2Downloading ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Downloading Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime..."
LangString webview2InstallError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 installation failed. Exit code: $1"
LangString webview2InstallSuccess ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 Runtime is ready."
LangString deleteAppData ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Delete local webview data (project configuration is kept)"
LangString FlashRunWelcomeTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Welcome to FlashRun"
LangString FlashRunWelcomeText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Bring your projects, commands and terminals into one workspace.$\r$\n$\r$\nThis wizard will install FlashRun on your computer. Close FlashRun before continuing.$\r$\n$\r$\nClick Next to choose an installation folder."
LangString FlashRunFinishTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "FlashRun is ready"
LangString FlashRunFinishText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installation is complete.$\r$\n$\r$\nOpen FlashRun, add a project folder and choose a command to get started.$\r$\n$\r$\nClick Finish to close this wizard."
LangString FlashRunLaunch ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Open FlashRun"
